{"version":1,"key":"card:582","content":{"id":582,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8bd9123f-99e5-4d88-a090-c42dcf36be8d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是指 Cookie、TLS 客户端证书、保存用户名和密码的认证信息的数据。在使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fetch"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 请求数据时，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 参数控制是否携带 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 信息，它有三种取值："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"c2f86696-61cb-4529-afb7-433feaa1f9ec","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7446c798-ebbd-4fd9-9e98-bc0644451da8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"16fc3f3e-abe4-427e-8f2d-54614c362f46","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"omit"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在任何条件下，请求和响应中均不携带 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"56f09bdb-a2f3-4c72-876e-0d9bdb2848ac","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7817fb25-7b6b-42cd-a9ab-0485cc52861f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"same-origin"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：默认值，仅在同域请求的情况下携带 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4436b3fc-4b7b-41b2-8388-71b79a8bbd61","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f22ed618-e796-4260-9b1c-261119cb99ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"include"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：始终携带 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即使跨域"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"385a53ff-e6b8-4501-8778-02a0bb29ac3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于跨域请求，如果设置了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials: include"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，很容易引发 CSRF 攻击，因此还需要服务端设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 响应头，并且 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值必须明确，即不能使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"*"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这样的通配符。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"99a5af79-f54d-4ef4-83f5-f2092cf0dfb7","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"17fbbf98-a6be-409d-88a5-59d4d04680a0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"af914db6-7728-4005-a8b8-b47d514732c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于简单请求，服务端必须设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 响应头，否则浏览器会直接返回网络错误"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1a7d79a4-746b-4aca-aae6-85c7b7dfe2a8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4e0054fb-696e-4ac0-abaf-bc2c674709af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于非简单请求，会先发送一个"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"不携带"},{"type":"formatted","text":" "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的预检请求，如果服务端没有正确设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 响应头，那么浏览器直接返回网络错误，如果正确设置了，才会发送携带 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"credentials"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的真实请求"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a32e3c11-2336-4828-9b33-8baf74cb3525","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"是否可以携带 Cookie，还受到 Cookie 的 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":1397,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":567,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"75301d12-945a-4aee-aa5e-ac0e95fb9ddc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SameSite"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性的影响。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f0f22e89-7765-48a4-9e44-c33ed7281884","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b6ef27fa-b122-4dc0-9f96-0f19ec335b0e","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a3fba7c0-c317-4024-a524-825b00dd2f7a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4302635e-1cd5-466d-8b98-c28cde6daa0c